Brought out from the middle of Babel,
I leave all parties and sects behind;
My heart is opened wide, my thinking free;
Wherever I find hidden truth,
I gladly accept that hidden truth,
And bow to the name of Jesus alone.

Set free by your almighty grace,
I enjoy my glorious freedom;
I welcome the whole world with open arms,
But hold tight to those who hold tight to you;
I take delight only in your saints,
Who walk with God in purest white.
